PR Description:
## Summary
This pull request merges the `feature` branch into `main` to add the feature branch logging line in `main.py` alongside the existing main branch update.

## Why this change
Isolating the new feature on `feature` lets us test changes safely before integrating them, and merging into `main` updates the primary branch with a clean record of how conflicting edits were resolved.

## How to test
1. Run `git checkout main` and `git pull origin main`.
2. Inspect the merged changes using `git log -n 2` or `git diff HEAD~1`.
3. Execute `python main.py` and confirm the expected output displays both lines:
   Main Update
   Feature Update


